# What `podman build` must not be handed as context. Without this file the
# daemon receives the whole working directory — half a gigabyte of build
# trees, agent worktrees and .git for an image that needs none of it — and
# `COPY . /src` bakes all of it into a published reproduction image.
#
# The list is .gitignore's directories plus .git itself: everything here is
# either generated on this machine or is history the image does not build
# from. A fresh `git clone` carries none of it, and the image must not differ
# by having been built from a working tree instead of a clone.
.git
.claude
.cache
build
build-cuda
explain
compile_commands.json
web_interface/runs
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
article/*.aux
article/*.log
article/*.out
article/*.fls
article/*.fdb_latexmk
article/*.bbl
article/*.blg
article/*.synctex.gz
Manifest.toml
